// Ch12 B09 "Cloudloom" (P → C, 3 min), B10 "Hesk" (C, 3.5 min) and B11 "Prayers." (C, 1 min).
// act2_ch12.md §2 B09-B11. RULE 1: Cloudloom is stone, cord and sky; NOTHING FROZEN. K05: the open-roofed
// weaving-hall, thousands of keth stirring in the thin wind, a white floor. K06: NOON: the cords' shadows on
// the floor like writing; the whole floor is a page. C02: Hesk, a great condor whose feathers are knotted
// cords lit from inside, a keth bundle in one talon (bound light, still). C03: the binding: the fifth verse
// comes down from the open sky (`hesk_bound`, a plain reader's voice; no words written here, Audio's
// Lamptongue); the shadows on the floor move as if the writing were rewritten; the sleeve reaches S5.
// C04: Hesk's head turns to one dark old bundle above the dais (a turn only). C05: Ysolde reads it by touch;
// HER FACE DOESN'T CHANGE: that is the tell. C06: Toma watching her. B11: she lies, kindly and plausibly,
// and walks away down the aisle first, faster than she climbed it.
title: ch12_hesk
location: ch12/cloudloom
---
@letterbox on
@camera K05
@music cloudloom fade=2.0
@wait 4.0
@camera C01
@mark asha hesk_dais walk
@wait 3.0
@camera K06
@wait 5.0
@camera C02
@vfx glimmer_bound at=hesk count=1
@wait 3.0
@camera C03
@anim asha raise_staff
@music hesk_bound fade=0.0
@wait 8.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=asha_sleeve count=5
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch12_hesk_bound = true>>
@camera C04
@anim hesk turn_head old_bundle
@wait 3.0
@camera C05
@mark ysolde old_bundle walk
@anim ysolde read_by_touch
@wait 5.0
@camera C06
@anim toma look_at ysolde
@wait 3.0
@music cloudloom fade=2.0
@camera C07
@mark asha old_bundle walk
Asha [neutral]: What do they say? #line:ch12_prayers_001
Ysolde [neutral]: Prayers. A pilgrim's devotions. The Cantor who stayed here was Ullari: they tie everything. #line:ch12_prayers_002
@anim ysolde let_cords_fall
Ysolde [neutral]: It is very old wool. #line:ch12_prayers_003
@camera C08
@mark ysolde aisle_out walk
@anim rhen look_at ysolde
@anim toma look_at ysolde
@wait 3.0
<<set $ch12_ysolde_lied = true>>
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
